==Finnish==
[[File:Clarion Hotel Helsinki, pool, Clarion Hotel Helsinki, 20231215 - 01.jpg|thumb]]

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*aldas}} (compare {{cog|krl|allaš||trough}}), derived from a root borrowed from {{der|fi|gem-pro|*aldǭ||trough}} (whence e.g. {{cog|no|olda}} and separately also {{m|fi|aalto}}). The ending has probably been modified to {{m|fi||-as}} by analogy with other Germanic loans (such as {{m|fi|valas}}).

