{{fi-pronunciation}}

===Noun===
{{fi-noun}}

# a [[closed]] [[body]] of [[water]], e.g. a [[lagoon]]
# [[reservoir]] {{gloss|natural or artificial lake used as a source of water supply}}
# {{lb|fi|geography}} [[glacial]] [[basin]] {{gloss|a depression, often filled with water, caused by glaciation}}
# [[tank]] {{gloss|open container for liquids}}
# [[pool]], [[swimming pool]]
#: {{syn|fi|uima-allas}}
